   "number": 1,
   "beat": "setup",
   "text": "In a sunny little village, the best place of all was the shared garden, where a bright stream bubbled between the flower beds. Mia visited every morning to say hello to the flowers.",
   "image_prompt": "Mia in a sunny community garden with tall sunflowers and a sparkling little stream flowing between flower beds",
