    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "number": 4,
   "beat": "decision",
   "text": "Mr. Bram, the old gardener, scratched his beard. 'Water always comes from somewhere,' he said. 'Follow the stream, and you'll find the answer.' So Mia and Nutmeg grabbed a basket and a watering can and set off upstream.",
   "image_prompt": "An old gardener with a white beard and straw hat pointing uphill along a dry streambed, Mia holding a watering can, Nutmeg with a basket",
   "characters_present": [
    "hero",
