  },
  {
   "number": 7,
   "beat": "ep_trash",
   "text": "Further on, they found plastic bags and old cans caught in the reeds. Mia and Nutmeg picked up every piece and put it in their basket. 'The stream deserves better than this,' said Nutmeg.",
   "image_prompt": "Mia and Nutmeg picking up plastic bags and cans from reeds and putting them in a basket beside a dry streambed",
