   "beat": "doubt",
   "text": "The sun grew hotter and the path grew longer. Mia's feet hurt. 'Maybe we should go back,' she sighed. Then she thought of the drooping sunflowers and the worried little frog, and she kept walking.",
   "image_prompt": "Mia sitting tired on a rock under a hot sun on a long dusty path, Nutmeg encouraging Mia to continue",
